#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/openssh.xml:33
#, xml-text
msgid "Introduction to OpenSSH"
msgstr "Introdução ao OpenSSH"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/postlfs/security/openssh.xml:36
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>OpenSSH</application> package contains "
"<command>ssh</command> clients and the <command>sshd</command> daemon.  This"
" is useful for encrypting authentication and subsequent traffic over a "
"network. The <command>ssh</command> and <command>scp</command> commands are "
"secure implementations of <command>telnet</command> and "
"<command>rcp</command>."
msgstr ""
"O pacote <application>OpenSSH</application> contém clientes "
"<command>ssh</command> e o processo de segundo plano "
"<command>sshd</command>. Isso é útil para encriptar a autenticação e o "
"tráfego subsequente em uma rede de intercomunicação. Os comandos "
"<command>ssh</command> e <command>scp</command> são implementações seguras "
"do <command>telnet</command> e do <command>rcp</command>."

